WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.867
-Good evening, everybody.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:03.235
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.570
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.573
And if you don't mind,
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:09.342
President Biden and
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.711
made a surprise trip
to Delaware yesterday

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:14.314
to cast their votes
in the state's primaries.

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:15.581
Though for what it's worth,

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:19.052
Biden just voted
the same way he always does.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:24.189
"Ah, simpler times."

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:26.693
President Biden today
toured the Detroit Auto Show.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.228
And you're not
going to believe this.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:33.299
He traded the presidential limo
for a '72 Chevelle straight up.

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:37.970
MyPillow C.E.O. Mike Lindell
said in an interview yesterday

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.040
that FBI agents
seized his cellphone at

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.709
a Hardee's drive-through
in Minnesota.

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:46.946
The FBI says they weren't tipped
off about his location.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:49.849
They just assumed.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.951
"Hey, they want us to get
Lindell's cellphone."

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.854
"Alright.
Hardee's drive-through?"

00:00:55.854 --> 00:00:58.224
That's right -- MyPillow C.E.O.
Mike Lindell said

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.226
that FBI agents
seized his cellphone

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.627
at a Hardee's drive-through.

00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:05.231
So not a great way
to start his job interview.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.468
After the death of
Queen Elizabeth,

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:11.638
Britain's Prince William
reportedly inherited

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:15.674
a 685-year-old estate
worth $1 billion,

00:01:15.674 --> 00:01:19.679
which I think makes him
a suspect.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:27.453
President Biden said yesterday
during a celebration

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:29.589
at The White House
that his recently passed

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:33.092
Inflation Reduction Act
is a win for the middle class.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:36.429
"Thanks," said the one guy
still in it.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:39.499
That's right --
President Biden hosted

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.300
a celebration at
The White House yesterday.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.770
They were originally going to
ask The Beach Boys,

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:47.474
but Biden said, "Let's get
someone the kids will like."

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:51.644
So, we -- Can we go back there?

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:53.379
What did I miss?

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:57.583
Go back. Yeah, okay.
One more card.

00:01:57.583 --> 00:02:01.855
So, we missed the part
that James Taylor played at it.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:12.999
And that's a detail we call
"key to the joke."

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.871
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.344
Now -- now,
halfway through the joke,

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:28.314
I realized the problem, guys.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:30.149
But I also --
There was no way --

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:31.584
And I feel like
I'm pretty good on my feet.

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:35.421
There was no way
for me to fix it.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:37.189
Here's how it would have looked
if I tried to fix it

00:02:37.189 --> 00:02:38.190
the way I thought I would.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:40.092
Alright, ready?
Wally, thank you.

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:42.494
That's right -- President Biden
hosted a celebration

00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:44.297
at The White House yesterday,
and they were gonna --

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:45.364
James Taylor was there.

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:47.366
They were gonna originally --

00:02:47.366 --> 00:02:48.768
And they asked James Taylor --

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:51.371
They were going to originally
ask The Beach Boys.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.875
How you feeling, Wally?

00:02:57.843 --> 00:02:59.312
-I'm not sure
that was my mistake.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.713
-Okay.

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.084
Yeah. Yeah, that's true.

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:07.120
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.857
It's always been a gray area
where cue cards land...

00:03:11.857 --> 00:03:14.327
-Yeah.
-...and your responsibility.

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:15.561
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:17.430
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:23.002
-During -- Well,
since he's wearing a mask,

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:25.872
let's edit him saying,
"Sorry, Seth."

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:30.310
During the event yesterday,

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.245
President Biden
wore aviator sunglasses.

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:34.113
Although, at this point,
it would be a big deal

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:37.083
if he wore any
other kind of sunglasses.

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:40.052
Yeah, see? Now, that's news.

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:41.153
Republican Senator
Lindsey Graham

00:03:41.153 --> 00:03:43.423
introduced a bill yesterday
that would

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:46.825
ban abortions after 15 weeks
of pregnancy nationwide,

00:03:46.825 --> 00:03:49.462
but just 'cause his
first pitch of banning sex

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:52.531
in general proved unpopular.

00:03:52.531 --> 00:03:54.033
According to a new survey,

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:58.304
67% of Americans said that they
are vaccinated against polio,

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:00.439
while the other 33% texted,

00:04:00.439 --> 00:04:03.676
"Mom, am I vaccinated
against polio?"

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:08.013
Ferrari yesterday
unveiled its first-ever

00:04:08.013 --> 00:04:11.350
four-door vehicle, which will be
an S.U.V.-like sports car

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.652
with a 715-horsepower engine.

00:04:13.652 --> 00:04:18.291
Perfect for taking your third
wife's kids to soccer practice.

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.560
And, finally,
NBC is set to premiere

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.163
a new show next month starring
the Harlem Globetrotters.

00:04:24.163 --> 00:04:26.265
It's called
"Chicago Globetrotters."

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:29.102
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:32.171
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:34.106
Let's see if Wally
got that card right.

00:04:34.106 --> 00:04:37.442
Oh, well, I guess that wasn't
the problem, then.

00:04:37.442 --> 00:04:41.013
That was a monologue, everybody.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.013 --> 00:04:42.749
Whoo! Off and running.

